      "name": "adjust_list_events",
      "title": "adjust list events",
      "description": "Discover native event base slugs, ordinary activity-count metric IDs and app-specific event tokens for one allowlisted Adjust app. Use activityMetric for counts; the event base slug alone is not a report metric. Keep SKAdNetwork and aggregate revenue definitions separate.",
